=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Waoud} (J-10) {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} to flag the quest.
** Remember to set the {p:Records of Eminence} quest under RoE > Objective > Tutorial > Level Cap Increase > Level Cap Increase: 75 (BLU)
* Obtain a {i:Blue Mage's Testimony|Blue Mage's Testimony|2331} from {m:Mamool Ja Mimickers|Mamool Ja Mimicker}.
* Trade the testimony to the Imperial Whitegate and you will be teleported to {z:Jade Sepulcher}.
* Trade the testimony to the Ornamental Door to initiate a battle.
** Buffs wear upon entry.
** If you have the {k:"Rhapsody in Umber"} Key Item, you are able to summon {p:Trust Magic} to aid you.
* Defeat {n:Raubahn} to complete the quest and raise your level cap to 80.

=2 Notes
* Does not need to be completed (for level limit increasing) if the player has already completed {q:New Worlds Await|New Worlds Await|New Worlds Await}.

